 * OPTIMIZATIONS:
 * 1. ΓÜí React.lazy() code splitting - each step is a separate chunk
 * 2. ΓÜí Suspense with instant fallback - no loading flash
 * 3. ΓÜí GPU-accelerated transitions via transform3d
